{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:d55be647c6da9f31","name":"Corellian MT Dropship","source":{"id":"source:reference-d55be647c6da9f31","title":"Corellian MT Dropship","revision":20121,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:15:26Z","sha256":"8a49d9f3652148aa3f7ec452ab8f82fc5c1b1fc9b90a150e7ad299db4ac1f655","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20121","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Corellian%20MT%20Dropship&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-d55be647c6da9f31","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:bd53073ee6d4d9a0"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Corellian Engineering Corporation's MT Dropship is the standard means of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:bd53073ee6d4d9a0"}," to transport large numbers of troops and their heavy equipment and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," to a planet's surface. The ship is a towering, conical craft. The bridge and command center are located at the top of the truncated cone, giving the pilots and commanders a 360",{"tag":"sup","children":["o"]}," view of the area around them. Pilot stations can be configured to view out of the sides of the ship while descending, or up through the top while flying in space. Communications arrays jut out from the top of the cone, while the level below the command center is ringed with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Laser Cannons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Laser_Cannons"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concussion Missile Launchers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concussion_Missile_Launchers"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once on the ground, the sides of the cone's base retract to allow troops and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," to disembark quickly. The ship carries 200 troops plus gear and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeders"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeders","referenceId":"reference:be93ac2e4867f0ca"},", or 4 Huge ",{"tag":"a","children":["Walkers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Walkers","referenceId":"reference:552672704065a9f2"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeders"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeders","referenceId":"reference:be93ac2e4867f0ca"}," and up to 50 support troops.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ship is heavily armored and shielded, but is relatively slow and requires an escort to a battle zone. It is not hyperspace capable. It often serves as a shuttle, bringing down multiple waves of troops and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"},", and evacuating wounded or other personnel. It also serves as a central command post and communications center for troops on the ground.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Corellian MT Dropship Statistics (CL 15)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Colossal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Transport"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Transport"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," -2; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"